    {
      "id": "subjet-wise-01-001",
      "number": 1,
      "question": "What is the HCF of two or more prime numbers?",
      "options": {
        "A": "1",
        "B": "2",
        "C": "3",
        "D": "0"
      },
      "answer": "A",
      "explanation": "Prime numbers have no common factor other than 1, so their HCF is always 1.",
      "hash": "2450235e63e19fe0",
      "translations": {
        "hi": {
          "question": "दो या दो से अधिक अभाज्य संख्याओं (Prime Numbers) का म.स. (HCF) क्या होता है?",
          "options": {
            "A": "1",
            "B": "2",
            "C": "3",
            "D": "0"
          },
          "explanation": "अभाज्य संख्याओं में 1 के अलावा कोई उभयनिष्ठ गुणनखंड नहीं होता, इसलिए उनका HCF हमेशा 1 होता है।"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "subjet-wise-01-002",
      "number": 2,
      "question": "Which of the following is an irrational number?",
      "options": {
        "A": "√64",
        "B": "√81",
        "C": "√2.5",
        "D": "√49/9"
      },
      "answer": "C",
      "explanation": "√2.5 is not a perfect square, so it is irrational. Others (8, 9, 7/3) are rational.",
      "hash": "308ce739f8bbb2d0",
      "translations": {
        "hi": {
          "question": "निम्नलिखित में से कौन अपरिमेय संख्या (Irrational Number) है?",
          "options": {
            "A": "√64",
            "B": "√81",
            "C": "√2.5",
            "D": "√49/9"
          },
          "explanation": "√2.5 एक पूर्ण वर्ग नहीं है, इसलिए यह अपरिमेय है। बाकी (8, 9, 7/3) परिमेय हैं।"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "subjet-wise-01-003",
      "number": 3,
      "question": "What are the zeros of the quadratic polynomial x² - 3?",
      "options": {
        "A": "3, 3",
        "B": "-√3, +√3",
        "C": "-3, -3",
        "D": "-3, 3"
      },
      "answer": "B",
      "explanation": "x² - 3 = 0 => x² = 3 => x = ±√3.",
      "hash": "2d5c4e0d1f1110bd",
      "translations": {
        "hi": {
          "question": "द्विघात बहुपद x² - 3 के शून्यक (Zeros) क्या होंगे?",
          "options": {
            "A": "3, 3",
            "B": "-√3, +√3",
            "C": "-3, -3",
            "D": "-3, 3"
          },
          "explanation": "x² - 3 = 0 => x² = 3 => x = ±√3।"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "subjet-wise-01-004",
      "number": 4,
      "question": "In Euclid's division algorithm 'a = bq + r', which statement is true for remainder 'r'?",
      "options": {
        "A": "0 ≤ r < b",
        "B": "0 < r < b",
        "C": "0 ≤ r ≤ b",
        "D": "r > b"
      },
      "answer": "A",
      "explanation": "Remainder (r) is always greater than or equal to 0 but less than divisor (b).",
      "hash": "7b20a1f72c800e4b",
      "translations": {
        "hi": {
          "question": "यूक्लिड विभाजन एल्गोरिद्म 'a = bq + r' में, शेषफल 'r' के लिए कौन सा कथन सत्य है?",
          "options": {
            "A": "0 ≤ r < b",
            "B": "0 < r < b",
            "C": "0 ≤ r ≤ b",
            "D": "r > b"
          },
          "explanation": "शेषफल (r) हमेशा 0 के बराबर या बड़ा होता है, लेकिन भाजक (b) से छोटा होता है।"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "subjet-wise-01-005",
      "number": 5,
      "question": "For what value of k will equations x + 2y = 7 and 2x + ky = 14 be coincident?",
      "options": {
        "A": "2",
        "B": "3",
        "C": "4",
        "D": "5"
      },
      "answer": "C",
      "explanation": "For coincident lines: 1/2 = 2/k => k = 4.",
      "hash": "42a111e21319ce82",
      "translations": {
        "hi": {
          "question": "k के किस मान के लिए समीकरण x + 2y = 7 और 2x + ky = 14 संपाती (coincident) होंगे?",
          "options": {
            "A": "2",
            "B": "3",
            "C": "4",
            "D": "5"
          },
          "explanation": "संपाती के लिए: a1/a2 = b1/b2 = c1/c2 => 1/2 = 2/k => k = 4।"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "subjet-wise-01-006",
      "number": 6,
      "question": "If α and β are zeros of polynomial x² - 2x + 5, then value of (α + β) is?",
      "options": {
        "A": "-2",
        "B": "2",
        "C": "5",
        "D": "-5"
      },
      "answer": "B",
      "explanation": "Sum of zeros (α + β) = -b/a = -(-2)/1 = 2.",
      "hash": "5dae4e4abb4acaae",
      "translations": {
        "hi": {
          "question": "यदि α और β द्विघात बहुपद x² - 2x + 5 के शून्यक हैं, तो (α + β) का मान क्या है?",
          "options": {
            "A": "-2",
            "B": "2",
            "C": "5",
            "D": "-5"
          },
          "explanation": "शून्यकों का योग (α + β) = -b/a = -(-2)/1 = 2।"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "subjet-wise-01-007",
      "number": 7,
      "question": "How many solutions does the pair of linear equations 2x + 3y = 5 and 4x + 6y = 15 have?",
      "options": {
        "A": "अद्वितीय हल",
        "B": "तीन हल",
        "C": "कोई हल नहीं",
        "D": "अनगिनत हल"
      },
      "answer": "C",
      "explanation": "Since a1/a2 = b1/b2 ≠ c1/c2, there is no solution (parallel lines).",
      "hash": "6dab2cfb75cc8cf5",
      "translations": {
        "hi": {
          "question": "रैखिक समीकरण युग्म 2x + 3y = 5 और 4x + 6y = 15 के कितने हल हैं?",
          "options": {
            "A": "अद्वितीय हल",
            "B": "तीन हल",
            "C": "कोई हल नहीं",
            "D": "अनगिनत हल"
          },
          "explanation": "a1/a2 = 2/4 = 1/2, b1/b2 = 3/6 = 1/2, c1/c2 = 5/15 = 1/3। चूंकि a1/a2 = b1/b2 ≠ c1/c2, इसलिए कोई हल नहीं (समानांतर रेखाएं)।"
        }
      }
    },
    {
